  data: {
    LLM: "Keep high cards (Aces/Kings). Since you don't have to follow suit, you can throw trash on opponent's winning trick or save an Ace for when you lead.\n\nThe 'Vol' Attempt: If you have 5 sure winners, lead them out to win instantly without letting opponents play. Since they don't have to follow suit, they can't trump you (no trumps?).\n\nTracking: 16 cards are undealt. Don't rely on counting specific obscure cards, but track Aces. If all 4 Aces are gone, Kings are bosses.",
